WEBVTT

00:01.403 --> 00:07.836
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:07.836 --> 00:10.770
[relaxing music]
[轻松的音乐]

00:10.770 --> 00:14.036
- FEEL THE DROPLETS GENTLY
CASCADE OVER YOUR BODY.
- 轻轻地感受水滴
层叠在您的身体上。

00:14.036 --> 00:16.070
- OH, YEAH.
- 哦，是的。

00:16.070 --> 00:19.936
- VISUALIZE YOURSELF
IN A PRIVATE GROTTO.
- 想象自己
在私人石窟里。

00:19.936 --> 00:23.503
FOCUS YOUR PERCEPTIONS
ON THE NATIVE FAUNA
聚焦你的看法
关于本土动物群

00:23.503 --> 00:26.170
AND THE SOOTHING NATURE
OF THEIR RUSTIC CALLS.
和舒缓的自然
他们质朴的叫声。

00:26.170 --> 00:28.270
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

00:28.270 --> 00:30.436
- YOU ARE ONE
WITH NATURE.
- 你们是一体的
与自然。

00:30.436 --> 00:32.570
- AHH.
-啊啊。

00:32.570 --> 00:34.470
[laughter]
[笑声]

00:34.470 --> 00:37.003
WHAT THE--
[laughter]
什么——
[笑声]

00:37.003 --> 00:38.570
BARNACLES!
藤壶！

00:38.570 --> 00:41.236
- HOW DO YOU LIKE THAT,
BABY?
- 你觉得怎么样，
宝贝？

00:41.236 --> 00:43.603
- [laughs]
OH, YEAH?
- [笑]
哦，是吗？

00:43.603 --> 00:47.403
WELL, WHAT DO YOU
THINK ABOUT THIS, BABY?
那么，你做什么
想想这个，宝贝？

00:47.403 --> 00:49.170
[laughter]
[笑声]

00:49.170 --> 00:50.970
- QUESTION,
ARE YOU TWO ACTING
- 问题，
你们两个是演戏吗

00:50.970 --> 00:54.170
EVEN MORE INFANTILE
THAN USUAL THIS MORNING?
更加婴儿化
今天早上比平常多吗？

00:54.170 --> 00:55.770
- UH-HUH.
'CAUSE I FOUND A BOX
- 呃哈。
因为我发现了一个盒子

00:55.770 --> 00:57.670
OF MY OLD BABY TOYS
IN THE ATTIC,
我的旧婴儿玩具
在阁楼里，

00:57.670 --> 01:00.370
AND WE'RE PLAYING
WITH THEM.
我们正在玩
和他们在一起。

01:00.370 --> 01:03.536
HEY, MY OLD TEDDY WALRUS.
[squeaking]
嘿，我的老泰迪海象。
[吱吱声]

01:03.536 --> 01:06.536
THIS STUFF
REALLY TAKES ME BACK.
这个东西
真的让我回想起。

01:08.136 --> 01:11.570
- YEAH,
IT MAKES ME FEEL BABYISH.
- 是的，
这让我觉得自己很幼稚。

01:11.570 --> 01:15.203
OH! LOOK AT ME,
I'M A BABY.
哦！看看我，
我是一个婴儿。

01:15.203 --> 01:17.636
- NO, BABIES DON'T TALK
LIKE THAT, PATRICK.
- 不，婴儿不会说话
就像那样，帕特里克。

01:17.636 --> 01:20.770
THEY TALK LIKE--
GOO-GOO, GA-GA.
他们说话的样子——
咕咕，嘎嘎。

01:20.770 --> 01:23.603
both: [baby gibberish]
两者：[婴儿胡言乱语]

01:23.603 --> 01:25.436
- [baby gibberish]
- [婴儿胡言乱语]

01:25.436 --> 01:30.936
- [baby gibberish]
- [婴儿胡言乱语]

01:30.936 --> 01:33.570
- [baby gibberish and whistling]
- [婴儿胡言乱语和吹口哨]

01:33.570 --> 01:39.770
both: [baby gibberish]
两者：[婴儿胡言乱语]

01:39.770 --> 01:43.036
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:43.036 --> 01:45.603
JUST AS THE ESSENTIAL OILS
WERE KICKING IN.
正如精油一样
我们开始行动了。

01:45.603 --> 01:48.870
HEY!
I'D APPRECIATE SOME QUIET.
嘿！
我希望安静一些。

01:48.870 --> 01:50.236
both: [gibberish]
两者：[胡言乱语]

01:50.236 --> 01:52.036
- HOW DARE YOU
SCOOT AWAY FROM ME?
- 你怎么敢
远离我？

01:52.036 --> 01:54.603
I'M SCOLDING HERE!
我在这里骂人！

01:54.603 --> 01:58.236
WOULD YOU TWO FOR ONCE
ACT YOUR AGE?
你们两个愿意一次吗
表现出你的年龄？

01:58.236 --> 01:59.770
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

01:59.770 --> 02:04.136
both: [crying]
两人：[哭泣]

02:04.136 --> 02:07.136
- FINE, ACT LIKE INFANTS
YOUR WHOLE LIFE.
- 好吧，像婴儿一样行事
你的一生。

02:07.136 --> 02:08.403
SEE IF I CARE.
看看我是否在乎。

02:08.403 --> 02:10.970
I'LL BE RETURNING
TO MY GROWN-UP LIFESTYLE,
我会回来的
对于我长大后的生活方式，

02:10.970 --> 02:12.870
SO KEEP IT DOWN!
所以保持低调！

02:12.870 --> 02:15.970
AAH!
啊啊！

02:15.970 --> 02:18.836
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:18.836 --> 02:20.536
both: SQUIDWARD!
两人：章鱼哥！

02:20.536 --> 02:24.203
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

02:24.203 --> 02:25.636
[gibberish]
[胡言乱语]

02:25.636 --> 02:29.103
- HEY, HE'S MUMBLING
AND DROOLING LIKE A LITTLE BABY.
- 嘿，他在咕哝
像小婴儿一样流口水。

02:29.103 --> 02:30.603
- OOH, I DON'T KNOW,
PATRICK.
- 哦，我不知道，
帕特里克。

02:30.603 --> 02:32.103
HE ISN'T LOOKING
SO GOOD.
他没在看
太好了。

02:32.103 --> 02:33.770
HE SHOULD PROBABLY
SEE A DOCTOR.
他或许应该
看医生。

02:33.770 --> 02:35.970
COME ON, LET'S TAKE HIM
TO THE HOSPITAL.
来吧，我们带他走
去医院。

02:35.970 --> 02:37.270
- HANG IN THERE,
BUDDY.
- 坚持住，
伙计。

02:37.270 --> 02:39.036
WE'LL HAVE YOU FIXED UP
IN NO TIME.
我们会帮您解决的
立刻。

02:39.036 --> 02:41.036
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

02:42.303 --> 02:43.570
- HMM.
- 唔。

02:43.570 --> 02:45.903
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

02:45.903 --> 02:48.103
- SO WHAT'S THE PROGNOSIS,
DOCTOR?
- 那么预测是什么？
医生？

02:48.103 --> 02:51.570
- YOUR FRIEND HAS A CONDITION
KNOWN BY THE MEDICAL TERM
- 你的朋友有病
以医学术语所知

02:51.570 --> 02:54.003
OF "HEAD-GO-BOOM-BOOM-ITIS."
“头-去-繁荣-繁荣-ITIS”。

02:54.003 --> 02:55.236
NOT TO WORRY THOUGH,
不过不用担心，

02:55.236 --> 02:57.436
HE SHOULD RECOVER NORMALLY
OVER TIME.
他应该会恢复正常
随着时间的推移。

02:57.436 --> 03:00.936
BUT HE MUSTN'T RECEIVE
ANY MORE BLOWS TO THE HEAD,
但他不能接受
头部再受到打击，

03:00.936 --> 03:04.536
OR HE MAY REMAIN
THIS WAY PERMANENTLY.
或者他可能会留下来
就这样永久地。

03:04.536 --> 03:06.136
JUST CARE FOR HIM
AS IF HE WERE
只要关心他
就好像他是

03:06.136 --> 03:11.003
YOUR VERY OWN BOUNCING BABY BOY,
AND HE'LL BE FINE.
您自己的弹跳男婴，
他会没事的。

03:11.003 --> 03:12.503
- HEY, LITTLE SQUIDWARD.
- 嘿，小章鱼哥。

03:12.503 --> 03:14.636
YOU READY FOR SOME FUN?
您准备好享受乐趣了吗？

03:14.636 --> 03:16.836
WHOOPY-DOO!
哎哟！

03:16.836 --> 03:19.436
- OKAY, SQUIDDY,
DIN-DIN IS READY.
- 好吧，鱿鱼，
DIN-DIN 已准备就绪。

03:19.436 --> 03:22.536
WHERE IS
OUR LITTLE MIRACLE?
在哪里
我们的小奇迹？

03:22.536 --> 03:25.570
[gasps]
PATRICK, HOW COULD YOU?
[喘气]
帕特里克，你怎么能？

03:25.570 --> 03:29.070
THERE, THERE,
MY LITTLE DARLING.
那里，那里，
我的小宝贝。

03:29.070 --> 03:32.003
WE'RE SUPPOSED TO PROTECT
HIS HEAD, REMEMBER?
我们应该保护
他的头，还记得吗？

03:34.203 --> 03:36.403
OKAY, SQUIDDY,
I MADE YOUR FAVORITE,
好的，鱿鱼，
我做了你最喜欢的，

03:36.403 --> 03:38.403
KRILL TARTARE
WITH AN ALGAE VINAIGRETTE.
鞑靼磷虾
配海藻油醋汁。

03:38.403 --> 03:40.570
HERE IT COMES,
OPEN WIDE.
它来了，
敞开。

03:40.570 --> 03:41.603
- MM.
- 毫米。

03:41.603 --> 03:42.770
- AW, COME ON,
LITTLE BUDDY.
- 噢，来吧，
小伙伴。

03:42.770 --> 03:43.970
YOU GOTTA EAT HEALTHY,
SO YOU CAN
你必须吃得健康，
所以你可以

03:43.970 --> 03:45.670
GROW UP BIG AND CRANKY.
长大后脾气暴躁。

03:45.670 --> 03:48.503
JUST WATCH THE AIRPLANE
LAND IN THE HANGAR.
只看飞机
降落在机库。

03:48.503 --> 03:51.536
[imitates airplane]
【模仿飞机】

03:51.536 --> 03:54.470
SEE, PATRICK, SOMETIMES
YOU GOTTA OUTTHINK THE BABY.
看看，帕特里克，有时
你必须比婴儿想得更多。

03:56.770 --> 03:59.503
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

03:59.503 --> 04:02.670
- YOU KNOW WHAT, PATRICK?
MAYBE WE--
- 你知道吗，帕特里克？
也许我们——

04:02.670 --> 04:05.903
- AHH, THANKS FOR SHARING,
BABY.
- 啊，谢谢分享，
宝贝。

04:05.903 --> 04:08.570
- OKAY,
TIME TO LIVEN THINGS UP.
- 好吧，
是时候让事情变得活跃起来了。

04:08.570 --> 04:09.836
DO YOU LIKE GAMES,
SQUIDDY?
你喜欢游戏吗？
鱿鱼？

04:09.836 --> 04:11.670
- GAMES IS
OUR MIDDLE NAME.
- 游戏是
我们的中间名。

04:11.670 --> 04:13.570
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

04:13.570 --> 04:16.303
both: KELPY CAKE, KELPY CAKE,
KELPY MAN,
两者：海带蛋糕，海带蛋糕，
凯尔比人，

04:16.303 --> 04:19.236
BAKE US A CAKE
AS FAST AS YOU CAN.
给我们烤蛋糕
尽可能快。

04:19.236 --> 04:22.036
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:22.036 --> 04:24.003
[gibberish]
- YOU LIKE THAT, SQUIDDY?
[胡言乱语]
- 你喜欢这样吗，鱿鱼？

04:24.003 --> 04:25.770
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

04:25.770 --> 04:26.936
- HE DOES!
- 他做到了！

04:26.936 --> 04:28.170
- NOW YOU TRY.
- 现在你试试。

04:28.170 --> 04:30.903
both: KELPY CAKE--
两者：海带蛋糕--

04:30.903 --> 04:33.836
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:33.836 --> 04:35.036
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

04:35.036 --> 04:36.336
- THIS GAME'S
KINDA DANGEROUS.
- 这个游戏的
有点危险。

04:36.336 --> 04:38.403
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

04:38.403 --> 04:40.336
both: SQUIDDY!
两人：鱿鱼！

04:44.303 --> 04:46.936
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

04:46.936 --> 04:49.036
both: SQUIDDY, NO!
两人：鱿鱼，不！

04:49.036 --> 04:51.970
- DON'T WORRY,
I'VE GOT THIS.
- 别担心，
我有这个。

04:53.903 --> 04:55.903
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:57.836 --> 05:00.136
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

05:00.136 --> 05:03.936
[gasps]
SQUIDWARD!
[喘气]
章鱼哥！

05:03.936 --> 05:06.936
SQUIDDY, ARE YOU OKAY?
鱿鱼，你还好吗？

05:10.603 --> 05:13.536
WE NEED TO DO A BETTER JOB
OF PROTECTING HIM.
我们需要做得更好
保护他。

05:16.636 --> 05:19.536
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

05:19.536 --> 05:21.203
- THERE, THERE, NOW.
- 那里，那里，现在。

05:21.203 --> 05:24.170
NO NEED TO CRY.
无需哭泣。

05:24.170 --> 05:28.303
[shushing]
[嘘]

05:28.303 --> 05:29.770
EVERYTHING'S
GONNA BE OKAY.
一切的
会没事的。

05:29.770 --> 05:31.103
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

05:31.103 --> 05:32.770
- EH, DON'T WORRY,
HE'LL--
- 呃，别担心，
他——

05:32.770 --> 05:35.236
HE'LL BE SETTLED DOWN
IN A COUPLE MINUTES.
他会安定下来
几分钟后。

05:35.236 --> 05:40.170
- [crying]
[cheerful music on TV]
- [哭泣]
[电视上欢快的音乐]

05:41.903 --> 05:44.336
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:44.336 --> 05:48.136
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:48.136 --> 05:52.070
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:55.536 --> 05:58.370
[crying]
[哭泣]

06:01.403 --> 06:03.870
[crying]
[哭泣]

06:03.870 --> 06:07.870
[crying]
[哭泣]

06:15.770 --> 06:17.803
- IT'S ONE MINUTE
TILL OPENING.
- 一分钟
直到开幕。

06:17.803 --> 06:20.270
WHERE THE BARNACLES
ARE ME EMPLOYEREES?
藤壶在哪里
我是雇员吗？

06:20.270 --> 06:21.903
I DON'T PAY 'EM TO BE LATE.
我不会因为迟到而付钱给他们。

06:21.903 --> 06:23.836
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

06:25.770 --> 06:28.103
- TAKING CARE OF A BABY
SURE IS HARD.
- 照顾婴儿
当然很难。

06:28.103 --> 06:30.103
- YOU SAID IT.
I'M EXHAUSTED.
- 你说过的。
我累极了。

06:30.103 --> 06:31.770
HEY, PATRICK,
I HAVE TO GO TO WORK.
嘿，帕特里克，
我必须去上班。

06:31.770 --> 06:33.203
WOULD YOU MIND
HOLDING SQUIDW--
你介意吗
拿着鱿鱼--

06:33.203 --> 06:34.770
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

06:34.770 --> 06:35.936
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

06:35.936 --> 06:37.436
LOOKS LIKE WE'RE ON OUR OWN,
LITTLE FELLA.
看起来我们只能靠自己了
小家伙。

06:37.436 --> 06:40.603
SPONGEBOB, SQUIDWARD,
ENOUGH DUFF-DRAGGIN'.
海绵宝宝、章鱼哥、
够了。

06:40.603 --> 06:42.770
GET TO YOUR STATIONS,
PRONTO.
到达您的车站，
很快。

06:42.770 --> 06:44.870
- MR. KRABS, SQUIDWARD
IS IN NO CONDITION
- 先生。螃蟹、章鱼哥
没有任何状况

06:44.870 --> 06:46.770
TO PERFORM
HIS KRUSTY DUTIES.
表演
他的职责。

06:46.770 --> 06:50.103
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

06:50.103 --> 06:51.770
- THE POOR GUY HAS
THE MIND OF AN INFANT.
- 可怜的家伙有
婴儿的心灵。

06:51.770 --> 06:54.336
- I DON'T CARE IF HE HAS
SEAWEED FOR BRAINS.
- 我不在乎他是否有
海藻补脑。

06:54.336 --> 06:56.403
HE NEEDS TO BE
BEHIND THAT REGISTER.
他需要成为
在该寄存器后面。

06:56.403 --> 06:58.170
WE GOT CUSTOMERS OUT THERE
JUST BEGGING
我们有客户
只是乞讨

06:58.170 --> 06:59.570
TO HAND ME THEIR MONEY.
把他们的钱交给我。

06:59.570 --> 07:01.103
- OH, PLEASE!
- PLEASE!
- 哦，拜托！
- 请！

07:01.103 --> 07:03.770
- TAKE OUR MONEY!
- PLEASE, MR. KRABS.
- 拿走我们的钱！
- 请，先生。螃蟹。

07:03.770 --> 07:04.903
- BUT--
- NO BUTS!
-但是--
- 没有屁股！

07:04.903 --> 07:08.770
GET TO WORK, YOU TWO.
你们两个，开始工作吧。

07:08.770 --> 07:11.236
- ALL SETTLED
INTO YOUR WORKSTATION, I SEE.
- 一切都已尘埃落定
进入你的工作站，我明白了。

07:11.236 --> 07:13.770
MAYBE YOU'RE READY FOR
YOUR KRUSTY DUTIES AFTER ALL.
也许你已经准备好
毕竟你的职责。

07:13.770 --> 07:15.636
NOW LET'S MAKE IT OFFICIAL.
现在让我们正式宣布吧。

07:15.636 --> 07:16.670
- [mumbles]
- [咕哝]

07:16.670 --> 07:20.436
- [chuckles]
HOW SILLY OF ME.
- [轻笑]
我真傻。

07:20.436 --> 07:23.370
SQUIDDY NEEDS
A HIGH CHAIR.
鱿鱼需求
一把高脚椅。

07:25.336 --> 07:28.803
[register dings]
AND DUCT TAPE!
[登记叮叮声]
还有管道胶带！

07:28.803 --> 07:31.436
OH, SQUIDDY,
I'M SO PROUD OF YOU.
哦，鱿鱼，
我为你感到骄傲。

07:31.436 --> 07:33.536
JUST YESTERDAY YOU WERE
DROOLING ALL OVER ME.
就在昨天你还在
流口水在我身上。

07:33.536 --> 07:35.770
AND LOOK AT YOU NOW,
WORKING
看看现在的你，
工作

07:35.770 --> 07:37.336
AND SITTING IN
A BIG BOY SEAT.
并坐在
一个大男孩座椅。

07:37.336 --> 07:39.503
- ALL RIGHT,
THAT'S ENOUGH, YOU TWO.
- 好吧，
够了，你们两个。

07:39.503 --> 07:41.370
TIME TO SERVE
SOME CUSTOMERS.
服务时间
一些客户。

07:41.370 --> 07:43.203
[indistinct chatter]
- ALL RIGHT!
[模糊的喋喋不休]
- 好吧！

07:43.203 --> 07:46.870
- REMEMBER, BUDDY,
I'LL BE RIGHT BEHIND YA.
- 记住，伙计，
我就在你身后。

07:46.870 --> 07:50.503
- CAN I GET A KRABBY PATTY
AND A LARGE KELP SHAKE, PLEASE?
- 我可以买一份蟹肉饼吗
还有一大杯海带奶昔，好吗？

07:50.503 --> 07:53.103
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

07:53.103 --> 07:55.603
- OKAY, HOW MUCH
DO I OWE YOU?
- 好的，多少钱
我欠你吗？

07:55.603 --> 07:58.636
- [laughs]
- [笑]

07:58.636 --> 08:01.036
- SQUIDWARD!
- 章鱼哥！

08:01.036 --> 08:04.336
THAT'S NOT FOR EATING.
那不是用来吃的。

08:04.336 --> 08:08.036
THERE WE ARE,
GOOD AS NEW--
我们在那里，
完好如新——

08:08.036 --> 08:10.636
THAT'S NOT
FOR EATING EITHER.
那不是
要么吃。

08:10.636 --> 08:12.436
SORRY, SIR.
- HOP TO IT, BOYS.
对不起，先生。
- 跳起来，孩子们。

08:12.436 --> 08:14.436
WE HAVEN'T EVEN TAKEN
OUR FIRST ORDER.
我们还没有采取
我们的第一条命令。

08:14.436 --> 08:15.770
- YES, MR. KRABS.
- 是的，先生。螃蟹。

08:15.770 --> 08:17.170
YOU KNOW WHAT TO DO.
你知道该怎么做。

08:17.170 --> 08:18.836
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:18.836 --> 08:22.203
- THANKS, SQUIDDY, I CAN ALWAYS
COUNT ON--HUH?
- 谢谢，鱿鱼，我总是可以
相信——嗯？

08:22.203 --> 08:26.703
WILL THIS BE FOR HERE
OR TO GO?
这是在这里吗
还是去？

08:26.703 --> 08:29.970
- [laughs]
- [笑]

08:29.970 --> 08:32.236
- YOU HAVE TO WORK
ON YOUR PENMANSHIP, SQUIDDY.
- 你必须工作
论你的书法，鱿鱼。

08:32.236 --> 08:35.103
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

08:35.103 --> 08:37.236
- MY FACE! MY FACE!
- 我的脸！我的脸！

08:37.236 --> 08:39.836
ALSO MY LEG,
BUT MOSTLY MY FACE!
还有我的腿，
但主要是我的脸！

08:39.836 --> 08:41.703
- HEY, YOU GONNA
TAKE AN ORDER, OR WHAT?
- 嘿，你会的
接受订单，还是什么？

08:41.703 --> 08:43.770
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

08:43.770 --> 08:45.370
[register dings]
[登记叮叮声]

08:45.370 --> 08:47.736
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:47.736 --> 08:49.236
- SQUIDWARD.
- 章鱼哥。

08:49.236 --> 08:51.503
YELLING AT A POOR,
DEFENSELESS BABY--
对穷人大喊大叫，
毫无防备的婴儿——

08:51.503 --> 08:52.803
YOU OUGHTA BE ASHAMED.
你应该感到羞耻。

08:52.803 --> 08:56.203
- LISTEN, MAN, I'M DONE
PLAYING THESE BABY GAMES.
- 听着，伙计，我已经完成了
玩这些婴儿游戏。

08:56.203 --> 08:57.536
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

08:57.536 --> 08:58.936
OH, MY NEPTUNE.
哦，我的海王星。

08:58.936 --> 09:00.503
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

09:02.703 --> 09:03.903
- OH, WHAT IS THAT?
- 哦，那是什么？

09:03.903 --> 09:05.303
- HEY, HONEY,
DID YOU, UH--
- 嘿，亲爱的，
你有吗，呃——

09:05.303 --> 09:07.236
- WHAT IN BLAZES
IS GOING ON AROUND--
- 火焰中的什么
正在发生——

09:07.236 --> 09:09.070
WHOA!
哇啊！

09:09.070 --> 09:12.836
MR. SQUIDWARD,
WHERE ARE YOUR MANNERS?
先生。章鱼哥，
你的礼貌在哪里？

09:12.836 --> 09:14.236
- MR. KRABS,
WATCH HIS HEAD!
- 先生。螃蟹，
小心他的头！

09:14.236 --> 09:15.603
- WATCH HIS HEAD?
- 观察他的头？

09:15.603 --> 09:18.603
WHY DON'T YOU
WATCH HIS DIAPER?
你为什么不呢？
注意他的尿布吗？

09:18.603 --> 09:20.636
AND GET IT CHANGED!
并改变它！

09:20.636 --> 09:23.036
- SIR, YES, SIR.
- 先生，是的，先生。

09:23.036 --> 09:25.403
- OH.
- WE'RE EATING HERE.
- 哦。
- 我们在这里吃饭。

09:25.403 --> 09:29.103
- SORRY.
- 对不起。

09:29.103 --> 09:30.803
- HEY, I'M TRYING
TO WALK HERE.
- 嘿，我正在尝试
步行到这里。

09:30.803 --> 09:32.603
- SORRY.
- 对不起。

09:32.603 --> 09:35.236
- HEY, I WAS GONNA
GET KETCHUP THERE!
- 嘿，我本来打算
那里有番茄酱！

09:35.236 --> 09:37.536
- SORRY.
- 对不起。

09:37.536 --> 09:40.636
- OKAY, SQUIDDY,
HOLD STILL.
- 好吧，鱿鱼，
保持不动。

09:40.636 --> 09:43.036
OH, BOY.
哦，男孩。

09:43.036 --> 09:45.103
- ARE YOU
OUT OF YOUR EVER-LOVIN' MIND?
- 你是吗
失去了你永远爱的心？

09:45.103 --> 09:46.670
YOU CAN'T CHANGE
THAT BABY OUT HERE
你无法改变
那个婴儿在这里

09:46.670 --> 09:48.003
IN FRONT OF THE CUSTOMERS.
在客户面前。

09:48.003 --> 09:50.436
TAKE HIM IN BACK
WHERE THE FOOD IS PREPARED.
带他回去
准备食物的地方。

09:50.436 --> 09:54.070
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

09:54.070 --> 09:55.570
OH, THAT'S IT.
哦，就是这样。

09:55.570 --> 09:58.770
GET THAT POOPY BABY
OUT OF ME RESTAURANT.
得到那个便便宝贝
走出我的餐厅。

09:58.770 --> 10:01.636
- [sniffs] MR. KRABS,
IF MY POOPY BABY
- [嗅嗅]先生。螃蟹，
如果我的宝贝便便

10:01.636 --> 10:04.336
ISN'T WELCOME HERE,
THEN I'M NOT STAYING EITHER.
这里不受欢迎，
那我也不会留下来。

10:04.336 --> 10:05.770
WHOA!
哇啊！

10:05.770 --> 10:07.470
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA,
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.
哇，哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇，哇，哇。

10:07.470 --> 10:12.270
[yelling]
[大喊]

10:12.270 --> 10:14.970
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:14.970 --> 10:16.903
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:19.303 --> 10:22.336
- [gasps]
SQUIDWARD.
- [喘气]
章鱼哥。

10:22.336 --> 10:24.936
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:24.936 --> 10:26.236
WHAT THE--
什么——

10:26.236 --> 10:27.770
WHERE AM I?
我在哪里？

10:27.770 --> 10:29.270
WHAT'S GOING ON?
这是怎么回事？

10:29.270 --> 10:32.170
- AH, SQUIDWARD, YOU'RE BACK
TO YOUR GROWN-UP SELF.
- 啊，章鱼哥，你回来了
致长大后的自己。

10:32.170 --> 10:34.003
- OF COURSE
I'M GROWN-UP.
- 当然
我长大了。

10:34.003 --> 10:36.836
WHY WOULDN'T I BE?
我为什么不呢？

10:36.836 --> 10:39.336
UM, I'M WEARING
A DIAPER.
嗯，我穿着
尿布。

10:39.336 --> 10:41.570
- YES.
- IS IT FULL?
- 是的。
- 满了吗？

10:41.570 --> 10:43.170
AAH!
啊啊！

10:43.170 --> 10:45.503
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD,
I WAS GONNA CHANGE IT, BUT I--
- 对不起，章鱼哥，
我本来想改变它，但是我——

10:45.503 --> 10:47.003
- STOP.
- 停止。

10:47.003 --> 10:52.536
NOT ANOTHER WORD
ABOUT THIS, EVER.
不是另一个词
关于这个，永远。

10:52.536 --> 10:55.403
- KIDS--THEY GROW UP
SO FAST.
- 孩子们——他们长大了
这么快。

- 孩子们——他们长大了
这么快。